@startuml
title 5. Editar transcripción

actor Inspector
participant Frontend
participant "Transcription API\nPUT /api/v1/transcription/{transcription_id}" as TranscriptionRoute
participant "transcriptionservice.updatetranscriptiontext" as TranscriptionService
database DB

Inspector -> Frontend: Edita texto final de la transcripción
Frontend -> TranscriptionRoute: PUT /api/v1/transcription/{id}\nTranscriptionUpdate
TranscriptionRoute -> TranscriptionService: updatetranscriptiontext(db,\ntranscription_id, payload)

TranscriptionService -> DB: SELECT Transcription by id
DB --> TranscriptionService: Transcription / null

alt Transcripción existe
    TranscriptionService -> DB: UPDATE Transcription\nfinaltext=payload.finaltext,\neditedmanually=True,\nupdatedat=datetime.utcnow()
    DB --> TranscriptionService: Transcription actualizada
    TranscriptionService --> TranscriptionRoute: Transcription
    TranscriptionRoute --> Frontend: 200 TranscriptionResponse
else Transcripción no existe
    TranscriptionService --> TranscriptionRoute: None
    TranscriptionRoute --> Frontend: 404 Transcription not found
end

Frontend --> Inspector: Muestra texto editado

@enduml